# The HMI Report on Advanced Level Work in Business Education and Economics 1991.

**Authors:** Butler, John

## Abstract
Evaluates 1991 report of Her Majesty's Inspectorate (HMI) on advanced level work in business education and economics for levels 16-19 in United Kingdom. Discusses areas of improvement and specific examples of good practice identified by HMI. Reports HMI's desire for better, more formalized departmental organization and the need for more in-service teacher education and connections with the business community. (SG)

